  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI've configured the media worker as explained in [workers.rst](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/workers.rst). Sometimes it sends these messages:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsynapse.rest.media.v1._base: [GET-11] Failed to write to consumer: <class 'Exception'> Consumer asked us to stop producing\r\ntwisted: [GET-11] \r\nRuntimeError: Producer was not unregistered for b'/_matrix/media/v1/thumbnail/matrix.org/zkSkrqEdMEIiBsiGsTjcoaal?width=46&height=46&method=crop'\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Version**: 0.99.2+stretch1\r\n- **Install method**: Debian package from marix.org\r\n- **Platform**: Debian stable",
